<title>JAPAN: Japan to hold T-bill auction on Thursday--MOF.</title>
<headline>Japan to hold T-bill auction on Thursday--MOF.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance (MOF) plans to hold a price-competitive auction of Treasury bills (T-bills) on Thursday, a MOF official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Traders said the MOF's offer is likely to be 1.5 tillion yen worth of three-month T-bills.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-33432-8570</p>
</text>
